---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "September 9, 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Maryam Akhyani"
  description="Terms covering the use of www.maryamakhyani.com and Maryam Akhyani's personal Google API automation."
  currentPath="/terms"
>
  <!-- Logo -->
  <a href="/" class="logo" title="Maryam Akhyani"></a>

  <section class="legal-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>
        These terms cover the website at www.maryamakhyani.com and a personal
        automation tool registered with Google as an OAuth application under the name
        "local gws". Both are operated by Maryam Akhyani as an individual, not as a
        business.
      </p>

      <h2>The website</h2>
      <p>
        This site is a personal portfolio offered for reading. Written work, case
        studies, photographs, and illustrations on it remain the property of Maryam
        Akhyani. You are welcome to read them and to link to them. Please do not
        republish them in full elsewhere without asking first.
      </p>
      <p>
        Content here reflects personal opinion and personal professional experience.
        It is provided as is, without warranty, and nothing on this site is
        professional advice.
      </p>

      <h2>The personal Google automation</h2>
      <p>
        The application "local gws" is private. It has a single authorised user, its
        owner, and it is not offered to the public. There is no sign up, no account
        creation, and no way for a third party to use it. It runs on the owner's own
        computer and reads only the owner's own mailbox, in order to build a personal
        daily reading digest.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because there is no public user, there is no service level, no subscription,
        and no fee. The tool may be changed or switched off at any time without notice.
      </p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        Do not attempt to gain unauthorised access to this site, its hosting, or the
        associated Google project. Automated scraping that degrades the site for other
        readers is not permitted.
      </p>

      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>
        This site and the personal tool are provided without warranties of any kind.
        Maryam Akhyani is not liable for any loss arising from their use or
        unavailability.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated from time to time. The date at the top of this page
        shows when they were last revised.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions can be sent through the contact details on the
        <a href="/">home page</a>. See also the
        <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    padding: 8rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .legal-section .container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal-section h1 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: #777;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: #d96d2b;
  }

  .legal-section p,
  .legal-section li {
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #333;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: #d96d2b;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-section {
      padding: 6rem 0 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
